NAME
       df - report free space on file systems

SYNOPSIS
       df [-hkPT] [file...]

DESCRIPTION
       Free space on the file systems holding the files
       (default: /). Numbers come from statfs; the file system
       name and mount point from /proc/mounts when it exists.

NOTES
       Needs the kernel's statfs; on a kernel without it, df
       says so.

SEE ALSO
       sh(1)

